      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.74,
      "end_seconds": 36.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "About a eight out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.74,
      "end_seconds": 43.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "any pain in your back and hips as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.47,
      "end_seconds": 55.45,
      "duration_seconds": 10.98,
      "text": "Yeah that too. As for pain in my back and hips honestly every other day. Regular tablets helps a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.2,
      "end_seconds": 80.25,
      "duration_seconds": 6.05,
      "text": "Okay, a few quick ones: vomiting, shortness of breath, confusion or bleeding?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.02,
      "end_seconds": 84.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "No I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.32,
      "end_seconds": 88.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "has your skin been okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.09,
      "end_seconds": 91.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "nothing on the skin, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.79,
      "end_seconds": 97.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.84,
      "end_seconds": 101.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "Hmm no I've always been fairly healthy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.94,
      "end_seconds": 107.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.25,
      "end_seconds": 111.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "I'm on morphine liquid, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.1,
      "end_seconds": 115.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "how much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.21,
      "end_seconds": 121.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.23,
      "text": "5 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.22,
      "end_seconds": 143.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.47,
      "end_seconds": 147.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "not to my knowledge, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.83,
      "end_seconds": 165.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Do you work outside the the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.01,
      "end_seconds": 170.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.67,
      "end_seconds": 174.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.32,
      "end_seconds": 178.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.31,
      "end_seconds": 182.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.08,
      "end_seconds": 187.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.14,
      "end_seconds": 205.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "time for your numbers, if that's okay"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.64,
      "end_seconds": 218.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "okay, this won't take long.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.98,
      "end_seconds": 253.2,
      "duration_seconds": 16.22,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 16, temperature 36.7. And blood pressure 127 over 77, saturation 97 percent, pulse is 80 beats a minute. Going by what you've described, it points towards cancer pain needing better control."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.76,
      "end_seconds": 257.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.12,
      "end_seconds": 296.15,
      "duration_seconds": 37.03,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like cancer pain needing better control. I'll start you on senna, 15 milligrams, at night, long term. It's for opioid-induced constipation. The pharmacy will go through the details again when you pick it up. Take the long-acting tablet regularly and the liquid for breakthrough pain. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.91,
      "end_seconds": 303.81,
      "duration_seconds": 5.9,
      "text": "let's get you seen by the palliative care team I'll arrange the letter"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.2,
      "end_seconds": 307.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "sure, where do I go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.58,
      "end_seconds": 312.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "I think we're done unless you have questions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 314.21,
      "end_seconds": 315.56,
